+refusal names the instant. The ring below holds two keys: `sunset` (open since `1700000000000`) and
+`sunrise` (open since `170000003600000`, the newest, and the one that signs), so `sunset` may leave
+at `170000003600000` plus the longest token lifetime — `1700007200000`.
 
